  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research Programme Consortium to analyse poverty drivers and opportunities and manage operational research in up to eight countries that will design and test innovative programmes that help households to escape or avoid extreme poverty.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Research Programme Consortium to analyse poverty drivers and opportunities and manage operational research in up to eight countries that will design and test innovative programmes that help households to escape or avoid extreme poverty. is a component of Data and Evidence to Tackle Extreme Poverty (DEEP) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;3,033,112. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Research/scientific institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
